WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:23.360 --> 00:30.120
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

3
00:30.120 --> 00:35.800
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

4
00:35.800 --> 00:38.400
♪ I don't understand ♪

5
00:38.400 --> 00:43.920
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

6
00:43.920 --> 00:48.720
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

7
00:49.080 --> 00:55.040
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

8
01:02.600 --> 01:05.760
I found a new potential investor who doesn't seem difficult to deal with.

9
01:05.760 --> 01:07.080
I'm so happy for you.

10
01:07.080 --> 01:09.680
You mean Parn isn't coming back to work?

11
01:09.680 --> 01:11.080
She won't accept me as a client anymore?

12
01:11.080 --> 01:13.080
Can you promise me something, Parn?

13
01:13.080 --> 01:14.680
Promise me that you won't lie.

14
01:14.680 --> 01:16.200
Then give me back my money.

15
01:16.200 --> 01:18.320
I'm trying to get it.

16
01:18.320 --> 01:19.880
But I really don't have it right now.

17
01:20.600 --> 01:21.680
Sis!

18
01:21.680 --> 01:23.080
I'll hurry and get the money to pay you back.

19
01:23.080 --> 01:24.120
One week.

20
01:25.560 --> 01:27.600
You must return the whole amount.

21
01:34.120 --> 01:35.640
Can you borrow Ms. Peem?

22
01:35.640 --> 01:37.280
I don't think we should.

23
01:37.280 --> 01:42.440
Come on, she has hundreds of millions. Borrowing ten won't make a dent in her fortune.

24
01:42.800 --> 01:46.960
Sis, but people will start thinking I'm after her money right away.

25
01:50.000 --> 01:52.479
But if we can't find it in seven days,

26
01:52.479 --> 01:55.039
the two of us are surely dead.

27
02:03.880 --> 02:04.960
Do your best in class, okay?

28
02:07.200 --> 02:08.039
Okay.

29
02:19.240 --> 02:20.160
Is something wrong?

30
02:24.320 --> 02:25.360
No.

31
02:27.840 --> 02:29.160
You should go to work, Peem.

32
02:53.000 --> 02:54.880
You didn't tell Ms. Peem?

33
02:54.880 --> 02:57.520
I'm worried here because I didn't tell her.

34
03:00.640 --> 03:02.280
Why didn't you tell her?

35
03:03.280 --> 03:05.000
Will she understand?

36
03:05.000 --> 03:07.880
She thinks what I do is selling my body.

37
03:08.200 --> 03:10.720
If I told her and she didn't allow me to come, what would Sis do?

38
03:10.720 --> 03:13.960
She got in debt herself but expects you to help pay for it.

39
03:13.960 --> 03:15.440
That's already wrong of her.

40
03:16.520 --> 03:17.640
Ah-ah-ah!

41
03:17.640 --> 03:19.920
Gratitude is one thing.

42
03:20.280 --> 03:22.440
But if you have to break up with Ms. Peem because of this,

43
03:22.800 --> 03:24.520
she won't be able to take responsibility, you know.

44
03:28.640 --> 03:30.200
This is our new shopping mall.

45
03:31.320 --> 03:35.240
I think this new project could help expand both our business models.

46
03:35.680 --> 03:38.760
If you’d like to see our malls, I can show you around.

47
03:39.320 --> 03:41.120
Before I came here to see you,

48
03:41.120 --> 03:42.720
I had visited every one of your malls.

49
03:47.520 --> 03:50.680
Right now, I’d much rather have a meal with you.

50
04:05.000 --> 04:06.800
Why did you ask to have a meal with me?

51
04:08.760 --> 04:10.440
I'd like to get to know you better.

52
04:11.560 --> 04:15.400
I want to know what you’re like when you’re not working.

53
04:20.079 --> 04:21.560
Am I being too direct?

54
04:26.160 --> 04:28.120
I'm not that interesting.

55
04:31.160 --> 04:32.240
You are interesting.

56
04:33.920 --> 04:35.440
Even I am interested.

57
04:51.400 --> 04:52.920
♪ Turn that body up ♪

58
05:09.400 --> 05:10.280
Hey.

59
05:11.320 --> 05:15.320
If you sit with the clients for me at a few tables,

60
05:15.320 --> 05:17.120
you can make ten million in no time.

61
05:17.520 --> 05:19.280
We've talked about this.

62
05:19.280 --> 05:21.160
I'm not accepting any clients and I'm not drinking.

63
05:21.160 --> 05:23.400
I'm only here to bring in clients and entertain them.

64
05:25.000 --> 05:26.800
I'm not selling my time to anyone anymore.

65
05:27.600 --> 05:29.840
Sure, lover girl.

66
05:29.840 --> 05:33.560
I know you give all your 24 hours to Ms. Peem.

67
05:34.760 --> 05:35.720
That's right.

68
05:40.120 --> 05:43.320
I'm already grateful that you came to help me bring in more clients

69
05:46.880 --> 05:51.040
By the way, won't she wonder why you're going home at 9 p.m. like this?

70
05:51.600 --> 05:53.320
She's been working hard lately.

71
05:53.320 --> 05:54.640
She comes home late every day

72
05:54.640 --> 05:56.880
because an investor from Singapore is here.

73
05:57.680 --> 06:00.920
Oh, so that's why you're only working here for seven days.

74
06:05.560 --> 06:06.880
Yeah.

75
06:06.880 --> 06:09.560
After seven days, I guess I won't be coming here anymore.

76
06:09.960 --> 06:11.240
I don't want to lie to her.

77
06:11.800 --> 06:13.240
That's good.

78
06:13.240 --> 06:15.400
I don't want you to do this job even for a day.

79
06:16.080 --> 06:19.800
I want you live like a madam, comfortably, and happily.

80
06:20.240 --> 06:23.560
And stay rich until you're old, so you can treat us to meals at expensive restaurants.

81
06:35.720 --> 06:36.920
You come home quite late, huh?

82
06:37.440 --> 06:41.159
I was at the bakery. And I was trying to come up with recipes for what I want to sell.

83
06:43.760 --> 06:46.640
I've been busy lately. I haven't really had much time for you.

84
06:48.440 --> 06:49.840
It's okay.

85
06:49.840 --> 06:51.800
There's nothing I need your help with right now.

86
06:51.800 --> 06:53.760
But if I need your help and you won't come,

87
06:55.240 --> 06:56.560
you're gonna get it.

88
07:01.440 --> 07:02.400
I want it now.

89
07:04.720 --> 07:05.800
Quit it.

90
07:11.320 --> 07:12.600
Go take a shower.

91
07:12.600 --> 07:15.600
You've been learning and baking since morning. It must be a long day.

92
07:17.640 --> 07:18.640
Well.

93
07:19.440 --> 07:21.080
I'll go take a shower then.

94
07:22.600 --> 07:23.720
If you don't stop now...

95
07:26.520 --> 07:27.520
I've stopped.

96
07:58.640 --> 07:59.720
Can I join you?

97
08:00.320 --> 08:01.880
Thought you wouldn't ask.

