I'm off to work now.

132
09:45.480 --> 09:47.560
I made breakfast for you. It's on the table.

133
09:49.000 --> 09:49.920
Okay.

134
09:51.160 --> 09:52.720
Do your best in class and come home soon, okay?

135
10:21.200 --> 10:24.240
I don't think I can accept the job anymore.

136
10:25.240 --> 10:26.800
Didn't you say it's a separate matter?

137
10:28.120 --> 10:31.840
I just feel uncomfortable doing this to Ms. Peem.

138
10:31.840 --> 10:32.920
Please, Parn.

139
10:34.360 --> 10:35.760
This time, it's really necessary.

140
10:36.960 --> 10:38.320
I beg you.

141
10:50.200 --> 10:52.840
Fine, but this is the last time, okay?

142
11:03.560 --> 11:04.840
You basically disappeared.

143
11:05.960 --> 11:06.960
Oops.

144
11:09.200 --> 11:11.000
Then, please excuse me.

145
11:11.000 --> 11:14.160
Next time we meet, I think we can talk about the numbers.

146
11:14.720 --> 11:16.400
- Sure. - I'll take my leave, then.

147
11:16.400 --> 11:17.040
Goodbye.

148
11:17.040 --> 11:18.000
Goodbye.

149
11:19.080 --> 11:20.200
Goodbye.

150
11:24.040 --> 11:27.040
So this is why you disappeared.

151
11:27.040 --> 11:29.040
You didn't answer when I asked you to play tennis.

152
11:29.040 --> 11:30.640
And you ignored me when I said we should grab a bite.

153
11:30.640 --> 11:33.560
All this time, you were busy with this guy.

154
11:33.560 --> 11:34.680
He's gorgeous.

155
11:35.400 --> 11:37.840
He's a Singaporean investor who's going to invest with us, so I'm busy.

156
11:37.840 --> 11:39.600
Yeah, I saw the news.

157
11:39.600 --> 11:41.160
It's all over my feed.

158
11:41.720 --> 11:44.080
You don't need to tell me. They already told me everything.

159
11:44.400 --> 11:47.640
There are even photos of you guys walking in the malls and eating together.

160
11:47.640 --> 11:50.080
Oh, they captured everything you did.

161
11:52.080 --> 11:55.440
Hey, come back and tell me everything. What happened?

162
11:56.680 --> 11:57.680
Hey, hey.

163
11:58.600 --> 11:59.840
So what's going on?

164
12:01.840 --> 12:03.600
- Not what you think. - Ah!

165
12:04.680 --> 12:05.680
No "ah."

166
12:05.680 --> 12:07.880
I came all the way here because I thought you got yourself a boyfriend.

167
12:07.880 --> 12:09.840
I wanted to tease you.

168
12:09.840 --> 12:13.120
You disappeared, so I thought you're head over heels in love and forgot about your friend.

169
12:13.120 --> 12:16.400
Turns out, you're still single.

170
12:18.400 --> 12:19.160
Jeez.

171
12:19.160 --> 12:22.480
I was hoping he could introduce me to his friends.

172
12:22.480 --> 12:23.560
What a bummer.

173
12:23.560 --> 12:24.440
I already have someone.

174
12:24.440 --> 12:25.680
Huh?!

175
12:25.680 --> 12:26.640
You have someone?

176
12:27.960 --> 12:29.440
Yeah, I do.

177
12:29.440 --> 12:31.120
I want you two to meet.

178
12:31.120 --> 12:32.520
But I've been busy lately, so I don't have time.

179
12:32.520 --> 12:34.440
You can't do that.

180
12:34.440 --> 12:36.240
I'm free, so set it up.

181
12:36.240 --> 12:39.400
Even if you ask when I'm busy, I'll make myself free. I want to meet them.

182
12:39.400 --> 12:43.720
I want to see the face of the person Peem loves.

183
12:44.800 --> 12:45.920
How about this?

184
12:46.320 --> 12:47.720
Let's meet up this evening.

185
12:47.720 --> 12:51.440
Go reschedule things with your secretary, and bring them to see me at the restaurant.

186
12:52.800 --> 12:54.600
I think I need to touch up my makeup a bit.

187
13:38.520 --> 13:39.560
She's not answering.

188
13:48.280 --> 13:50.480
Excuse me. Where's Parn?

189
13:50.480 --> 13:52.360
Ms. Parn didn't come today.

190
13:52.360 --> 13:53.760
She called in this morning.

191
14:10.640 --> 14:12.440
What time, baby?

192
14:13.360 --> 14:14.360
Oh.

193
14:15.240 --> 14:16.280
Jeez.

194
14:17.080 --> 14:19.840
Oh, finally, baby, come on.

195
14:19.840 --> 14:20.840
Why are you here alone?

196
14:20.840 --> 14:22.800
You said you're bringing her.

197
14:25.640 --> 14:26.800
- Hm? - She wasn't there.

198
14:27.200 --> 14:28.520
Why don't you call her?

199
14:28.520 --> 14:29.840
I did. She didn't answer.

200
14:29.840 --> 14:31.440
Huh? What the heck?

201
14:33.960 --> 14:37.360
Hey, it's fine. Don't worry. We can meet later.

202
14:37.920 --> 14:39.160
Let's look at this instead.

203
14:39.920 --> 14:42.480
The gossip of the day.

204
14:43.360 --> 14:44.520
I'm sure you'll like it.

205
14:46.280 --> 14:49.120
A friend of mine ran into him at the hotel today.

206
14:49.120 --> 14:51.920
He's with a woman, a pretty one too.

207
14:51.920 --> 14:53.640
We're all floored

208
14:53.640 --> 14:55.280
We've been saying he's gay for ages.

209
14:55.280 --> 14:56.160
Look now.

210
14:57.680 --> 14:58.760
Peem.

211
14:59.280 --> 15:00.200
Look.

212
15:01.760 --> 15:02.600
Here.

213
15:03.360 --> 15:04.800
Hey. Hey.

214
15:05.960 --> 15:08.040
Look here a bit. Pay a little attention to me, okay?

215
15:09.280 --> 15:10.560
Look a bit.

216
15:10.560 --> 15:12.840
He's actually your business rival, you know.

217
15:13.920 --> 15:17.160
I had someone follow him for quite a while before I got this photo.

218
15:17.160 --> 15:19.400
You have to give me credit for being so clever.

219
15:23.400 --> 15:24.320
Hey, Peem.

220
15:26.040 --> 15:26.960
Peem.

221
15:27.800 --> 15:29.960
I'm not eating anymore. My stomach hurts. I want to go home.

222
15:29.960 --> 15:31.560
Hey. Peem.

223
15:31.560 --> 15:32.800
Peem.

224
15:32.800 --> 15:34.440
What's wrong with her?

225
15:34.440 --> 15:35.760
Stomach hurts? Going home?

226
15:35.760 --> 15:37.360
Just say it if you wanna ditch me.

227
16:36.080 --> 16:37.040
Where have you been?

228
16:38.040 --> 16:39.720
A baking class, of course.

229
16:41.480 --> 16:44.200
And I stop by the shop every day to practice.

230
16:47.440 --> 16:49.360
Aw.

231
16:50.880 --> 16:52.160
You missed me?

232
16:56.320 --> 16:58.600
I'll take a shower quickly and then let's cuddle.

233
17:32.040 --> 17:34.880
Keep me updated at all times. Understand?

234
17:34.880 --> 17:35.800
Yes.

235
18:11.480 --> 18:12.960
Is this your last day?

236
18:15.000 --> 18:16.720
Well, you've already got your ten million.

237
18:17.840 --> 18:20.880
You don't think I should save some for later too?

238
18:23.280 --> 18:25.400
Ms. Peem has been coming home early for two days now.

239
18:26.080 --> 18:27.480
I'm afraid I might get caught.

240
18:27.480 --> 18:29.200
But you didn't do anything wrong, Parn.

241
18:29.640 --> 18:32.920
You don't drink. You don't make drinks for them. You don't sit and talk with them.

242
18:32.920 --> 18:36.040
You're just walking around greeting the guests. Can't she understand that?

243
18:42.200 --> 18:44.200
Today's going to be my last day, Sis.

244
18:51.240 --> 18:53.760
I'll go along with whatever you say.

245
20:52.280 --> 20:53.120
Peem.

246
20:55.360 --> 20:57.640
Don't call my name with your filthy mouth.

247
20:58.880 --> 21:00.200
Don't be mad.

248
21:01.920 --> 21:03.520
Do you like being a whore that much?

249
21:04.280 --> 21:05.920
Is that why you lied to me?

250
21:09.880 --> 21:10.840
Peem.

251
21:10.840 --> 21:12.800
If there's anything else you want, just let me know.

252
21:12.800 --> 21:14.760
You're regulars. Please feel free.

253
21:14.760 --> 21:15.680
Sis!

254
21:18.920 --> 21:20.920
Sorry. Hey.

255
21:24.000 --> 21:25.680
Sis, we're doomed.

256
21:25.680 --> 21:26.520
What?

257
21:26.520 --> 21:28.800
Ms. Peem is yelling at Parn in the front.

258
21:31.240 --> 21:32.240
Peem.

259
21:32.240 --> 21:33.040
Peem.

260
21:33.040 --> 21:34.160
Let go.

261
21:35.160 --> 21:36.600
Don't call my name.

262
21:36.600 --> 21:38.040
Will you please hear me out?

263
21:38.520 --> 21:39.560
About what?

264
21:40.000 --> 21:43.160
The lie you made up to fool a fool like me?

265
21:43.600 --> 21:44.800
Why should I do that?

266
21:46.760 --> 21:47.920
I know I was wrong.

267
21:51.280 --> 21:52.640
What did you do wrong?

268
21:53.240 --> 21:54.920
Going to the hotel with Techin?

269
21:55.320 --> 21:56.880
Lying to me?

270
21:57.440 --> 21:59.720
Or coming back here to work?

271
21:59.720 --> 22:01.080
You deceived me.

272
22:01.600 --> 22:03.080
You think I'm stupid?

273
22:03.840 --> 22:05.480
I didn't mean to deceive you.

274
22:06.600 --> 22:08.520
I'm just helping her out temporarily.

275
22:08.520 --> 22:09.920
She really has no money.

276
22:10.840 --> 22:11.920
And about Mr. Techin,

277
22:12.360 --> 22:13.800
it's not what you think.

278
22:13.800 --> 22:16.800
Right. It's really not what I think.

279
22:16.800 --> 22:19.560
I thought you stopped getting involved with him when you started seeing me.

280
22:20.080 --> 22:21.880
But you didn't stop.

281
22:21.880 --> 22:23.200
You never stopped.

282
22:25.000 --> 22:25.960
Ms. Peem.

283
22:35.280 --> 22:37.080
Pack your things and get out of my house.

284
22:37.080 --> 22:38.560
Get out of my life.

285
22:40.640 --> 22:42.320
I don't want to see you again.

286
23:17.600 --> 23:18.640
Parn!

287
23:21.760 --> 23:22.800
Parn.

288
23:43.440 --> 23:45.280
Sit down. I'll put this away for you.

289
23:45.720 --> 23:46.640
Sit.

290
24:03.960 --> 24:07.040
Do you want me to go tell her you're helping me pay off my debt?

291
24:08.520 --> 24:11.560
I think that's a good idea. She'll probably listen to her.

292
24:16.360 --> 24:17.520
I don't think you should

293
24:17.840 --> 24:19.400
Then what are you going to do?

294
24:19.400 --> 24:21.160
If you go back to apologize,

295
24:21.160 --> 24:22.640
will she even listen to you?

296
24:23.880 --> 24:25.040
I don't know.

297
24:31.880 --> 24:33.520
I'll go home and talk to her, Sis.

298
24:43.240 --> 24:44.160
Ms. Peem.

299
25:04.360 --> 25:06.080
Can you promise me something, Parn?

300
25:08.040 --> 25:09.600
Promise me that you won't lie.

301
25:14.000 --> 25:16.640
I don't know how long this happiness will last.

302
25:18.800 --> 25:20.080
It'll be long.

303
25:21.400 --> 25:23.080
It could even last a lifetime.

304
25:32.040 --> 25:33.240
She lied about everything.

305
25:38.760 --> 25:41.040
Was there nothing real between us?

306
26:10.600 --> 26:11.560
Ms. Peem.

307
26:15.800 --> 26:22.920
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

308
26:22.920 --> 26:25.920
♪ Why am I like this... ♪

309
26:25.920 --> 26:27.000
Is it good?

310
26:28.120 --> 26:30.880
♪ I don't understand ♪

311
26:30.880 --> 26:36.080
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

312
26:36.480 --> 26:37.600
♪ Why... ♪

313
26:37.600 --> 26:40.600
You told me that just staying by your side is enough.

314
26:40.960 --> 26:42.920
So I want to be by your side

315
26:42.920 --> 26:44.800
when you have to face things like this.

316
26:52.720 --> 26:55.680
♪ Just the one word, love ♪

317
26:56.080 --> 27:01.240
♪ I don't understand why I can't say it ♪

318
27:02.160 --> 27:04.920
♪ Why do I keep it to myself? ♪

319
27:05.560 --> 27:12.040
♪ I can only be angry with myself For acting so cold ♪

320
27:12.440 --> 27:17.520
♪ Making something so simple so complicated ♪

321
27:17.520 --> 27:19.600
♪ Even though my heart says... ♪

322
27:19.600 --> 27:23.080
I don't want you to think that I was with you for the money.

323
27:24.200 --> 27:26.160
All this time, I truly loved you.

324
27:29.800 --> 27:32.440
♪ I don't understand ♪

325
27:32.760 --> 27:37.640
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

326
27:38.040 --> 27:43.200
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

327
27:43.200 --> 27:47.520
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

328
27:50.640 --> 27:52.560
She probably doesn't want me to live there anymore.

329
27:53.880 --> 27:56.600
Now that you've left, when will you two get to talk again?

330
27:56.600 --> 27:57.800
I don't think we'll ever talk again.

331
27:58.600 --> 27:59.880
I think it's over.

332
28:03.680 --> 28:06.040
Have you told her about Mr. Techin?

333
28:06.680 --> 28:07.760
I beg you, Parn.

334
28:07.760 --> 28:09.320
What do I have to do?

335
28:09.880 --> 28:11.240
Just go see my family.

336
28:15.960 --> 28:17.720
You've done it several times.

337
28:19.160 --> 28:22.080
My family thinks we're dating now.

338
28:23.120 --> 28:26.720
You can't just suddenly disappear.

339
28:27.600 --> 28:28.640
At least,

340
28:29.440 --> 28:32.480
this time, we can pretend to fight.

341
28:32.480 --> 28:36.200
When I go to see them next time, I can tell them we've broken up.

342
28:36.760 --> 28:38.880
Why don't you just tell them?

343
28:44.160 --> 28:45.800
I'm an only son, Parn.

344
28:49.160 --> 28:51.160
What do you think they'll think...

345
28:56.520 --> 28:58.080
if they know I'm gay?

346
29:00.680 --> 29:02.960
How could I reveal his secret?

347
29:02.960 --> 29:04.400
Plus, they know each other.

348
29:04.800 --> 29:07.360
Jeez! If I were you, I'd tell her.

349
29:07.360 --> 29:08.720
I'd tell her everything.

350
29:08.720 --> 29:09.880
Are you crazy?

351
29:13.800 --> 29:16.640
If you tell her and it ruins him, that's his problem.

352
29:16.640 --> 29:19.120
But if you're not telling her, it's going to ruin you, you know?

353
29:23.640 --> 29:26.280
This is 100% your problem.

354
29:42.320 --> 29:43.880
I can still hear the phone buzzing.

355
29:47.640 --> 29:50.040
There she is! Is she dead?

356
29:55.080 --> 29:56.760
What am I supposed to hear?

357
29:57.120 --> 29:58.040
Heartbeat, sir.

358
29:58.040 --> 29:59.080
Heartbeat, right.

359
30:00.200 --> 30:01.840
Oh, it twitched!

360
30:01.840 --> 30:03.120
Oh my!

361
30:03.120 --> 30:04.880
How long has she been dead?

362
30:05.640 --> 30:06.960
Is the body already stiff?

363
30:06.960 --> 30:07.880
Not yet.

364
30:07.880 --> 30:08.960
Not stiff yet.

365
30:08.960 --> 30:10.440
Not dead.

366
30:10.440 --> 30:12.840
Right, her leg can still move, so she's probably alive.

367
30:14.120 --> 30:15.520
Peem!

368
30:15.520 --> 30:16.360
Jeez!

369
30:19.000 --> 30:20.080
Get up if you're not dead.

370
30:23.480 --> 30:26.120
Jeez! You scared me!

371
30:26.120 --> 30:27.520
Thank you.

372
30:27.520 --> 30:30.000
No problem at all. If you need help with anything, please feel free to call me.

373
30:32.480 --> 30:34.120
Why didn't you answer my calls?

374
30:34.600 --> 30:36.840
I thought you'd shriveled up and died here in your condo.

375
30:36.840 --> 30:38.560
That's why I rushed here.

376
30:40.600 --> 30:41.640
Thanks for your concern.

377
30:49.200 --> 30:51.600
Well, and that person...

378
30:56.440 --> 30:57.960
- Gone. - Huh?

379
31:00.320 --> 31:01.160
Gone?

380
31:02.520 --> 31:04.400
You want her to stay to rub it in my face that I'm a fool?

381
31:05.960 --> 31:07.320
Are you a fool?

382
31:11.840 --> 31:15.280
In the current situation, yes.

383
31:37.840 --> 31:39.560
Is it that bad?

384
31:46.400 --> 31:47.280
Are you okay?

385
31:49.600 --> 31:52.400
She changed my mind about women like my mom.

386
31:55.920 --> 31:59.880
I used to think these sex workers are always after money.

387
32:02.160 --> 32:04.680
But she convinced me that I was wrong.

388
32:06.640 --> 32:08.160
But right now,

389
32:08.520 --> 32:12.040
I don't know what's real and what's not.

390
32:14.920 --> 32:19.640
And I don't understand why she did this to me.

391
32:33.320 --> 32:35.640
And I've fallen in love with her.

392
32:37.640 --> 32:40.680
I love her more than anything else in my life.

393
32:53.120 --> 32:54.680
It's okay. I'm here.

394
32:55.280 --> 32:56.560
I'm here with you.

395
32:58.280 --> 32:59.640
You have me.

396
33:16.080 --> 33:17.440
I'd like to see Ms. Peem.

397
33:18.360 --> 33:20.080
Ms. Peem isn't coming in today.

398
33:20.640 --> 33:22.880
Do you happen to know when she'll come in again?

399
33:22.880 --> 33:24.280
We're not informed about that at all.

400
33:26.600 --> 33:29.080
I recommend calling her secretary to schedule your meeting first.

401
33:30.520 --> 33:31.440
Okay.

402
33:49.240 --> 33:51.880
Here, get up and swing it, girl.

403
33:51.880 --> 33:54.200
Let it all out, come on.

404
33:55.440 --> 33:56.320
Hey.

405
33:58.440 --> 33:59.280
Here.

406
34:00.560 --> 34:04.840
You two can break up, but you can't go around acting soulless like this. Get up!

407
34:06.640 --> 34:07.400
Jeez.

408
34:08.880 --> 34:11.120
Just be like the day you failed to close the deal.

409
34:11.120 --> 34:14.120
You two couldn't make it work because your needs didn't align.

410
34:14.120 --> 34:16.560
When you can't reach an agreement, you just break up and go your separate ways.

411
34:17.080 --> 34:17.960
Okay?

412
34:17.960 --> 34:19.040
It's as simple as that.

413
34:23.960 --> 34:26.239
Why would you date a bad person, huh?

414
34:32.040 --> 34:33.480
- Hey! - Ouch!

415
34:34.159 --> 34:35.199
Did it hurt?

416
34:35.679 --> 34:37.520
- Of course, it hurt. - If it hurt, then move.

417
34:37.840 --> 34:39.560
Be a little bit more lively.

418
34:41.719 --> 34:42.679
Come on.

419
34:42.679 --> 34:44.440
- I want to play now. - Ugh.

420
34:45.280 --> 34:46.960
You can do it!

421
34:51.360 --> 34:55.120
The Peem that I know is chic, fabulous, and smart.

422
34:55.120 --> 34:56.760
She doesn't care about anyone.

423
34:58.200 --> 35:00.000
Go back to being your old self.

424
35:00.000 --> 35:02.960
Let her see that she doesn't have that much power over you.

425
35:34.400 --> 35:36.960
Ms. Peem, here are the documents you need to sign.

426
35:38.800 --> 35:41.120
Also, Mr. David wants to schedule a meeting to discuss the price after this.

427
35:41.120 --> 35:42.720
Would you like to accept the invitation?

428
35:43.080 --> 35:43.920
Go ahead.

429
35:44.640 --> 35:45.840
Also...

430
35:46.200 --> 35:47.240
What else?

431
35:47.800 --> 35:49.640
Ms. Parn came to see you every day.

432
35:52.680 --> 35:53.960
She came today too.

433
35:54.760 --> 35:56.360
Would you like to see her, Ms. Peem?

434
36:06.520 --> 36:07.400
Okay.

435
36:08.080 --> 36:09.320
Let her wait in the reception room.

436
36:14.080 --> 36:15.960
Ms. Peem asked you to wait in this room.

437
36:16.280 --> 36:17.280
Thank you.

438
36:39.040 --> 36:41.280
- Mr. Techin didn't want me to... - I don't want an explanation.

439
36:44.040 --> 36:46.160
Was your life so hard when you're with me?

440
36:46.160 --> 36:47.680
Why did you have to accept the job again?

441
36:48.680 --> 36:51.360
- Sis Mol needs money to... - I asked if you didn't have enough money.

442
36:51.360 --> 36:53.720
Was your life so hard that you had to accept the job again?

443
36:55.400 --> 36:58.120
If it's so hard to be mine alone,

444
36:58.120 --> 37:00.040
just go back to being Paradise's Angel.

445
37:00.960 --> 37:02.680
And don't show me your face again.

446
37:03.400 --> 37:05.040
I don't want to see the face of a whore like you.

447
37:07.920 --> 37:15.040
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

448
37:15.040 --> 37:20.120
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

449
37:20.120 --> 37:22.960
♪ I don't understand ♪

450
37:22.960 --> 37:28.400
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

451
37:28.400 --> 37:33.160
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

452
37:33.600 --> 37:40.280
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

453
37:44.840 --> 37:47.800
♪ Just the one word, love ♪

454
37:48.160 --> 37:53.360
♪ I don't understand why I can't say it ♪

455
37:54.200 --> 37:57.640
♪ Why do I keep it to myself? ♪

456
37:58.520 --> 38:01.480
Mmm! What a surprise, baby!

457
38:01.480 --> 38:04.120
Good job! You did the right thing. That's my girl.

458
38:05.640 --> 38:07.840
Why do you keep sighing?

459
38:07.840 --> 38:09.520
You did the right thing, Peem.

460
38:09.520 --> 38:12.520
Let her know that someone like you is rare to find.

461
38:12.520 --> 38:14.800
Hey, don't be sad.

462
38:14.800 --> 38:16.360
Make her realize that, for someone like you,

463
38:16.360 --> 38:18.440
if she messes up, even if she comes crawling back to beg at your feet,

464
38:18.440 --> 38:21.160
she will never get you back.

465
38:21.160 --> 38:22.080
Haha!

466
38:30.000 --> 38:31.440
You have us here, you know.

467
38:33.880 --> 38:36.360
That's right. You still have me.

468
38:38.680 --> 38:40.680
Oh, and what about your shop?

469
38:41.440 --> 38:45.280
The rent, the decoration, and all the other expenses you have to cover.

470
38:46.040 --> 38:47.520
That's not a small amount of money.

471
38:47.520 --> 38:48.680
I'll work.

472
38:55.160 --> 38:56.280
If so,

473
38:57.680 --> 38:59.600
do you want to come back and work for me temporarily?

474
39:00.880 --> 39:02.240
Until your shop is finished.

475
39:02.240 --> 39:04.920
The decoration will cost quite a lot.

476
39:04.920 --> 39:08.360
If you just have expenses and no income,

477
39:08.360 --> 39:11.400
it'll be tough even if you have some money saved up.

478
39:20.240 --> 39:21.280
Thank you.

479
39:21.280 --> 39:22.200
Please have a seat.

480
39:23.960 --> 39:24.880
Thank you.

481
39:30.400 --> 39:32.160
Why do you want to meet here?

482
39:33.120 --> 39:34.320
Is it inconvenient for you?

483
39:34.920 --> 39:36.680
Are you afraid Ms. Peem will be angry?

484
39:38.840 --> 39:40.320
Ms. Peem and I have broken up.

485
39:45.920 --> 39:46.800
Was it because of me?

486
39:49.480 --> 39:50.800
Let's order some food.

487
39:55.640 --> 39:58.480
Have you told your family we've broken up?

488
40:03.480 --> 40:04.360
Not yet.

489
40:06.400 --> 40:07.880
I don't know how to start.

490
40:07.880 --> 40:10.000
My family wants us to get married.

491
40:14.800 --> 40:17.320
I haven't been able to get in touch with you much lately.

492
40:17.320 --> 40:18.360
Have you been busy?

493
40:19.400 --> 40:20.440
A little.

494
40:21.920 --> 40:22.840
Hello.

495
40:22.840 --> 40:23.920
Hello.

496
40:23.920 --> 40:26.480
Uh, a table for two, please. Can we sit at our usual spot?

497
40:26.480 --> 40:28.760
Your usual spot is taken, sir.

498
40:28.760 --> 40:30.560
Would you mind sitting near your usual spot instead?

499
40:30.560 --> 40:31.720
Uh, that's fine.

500
40:32.080 --> 40:33.240
Then please come this way.

501
40:33.640 --> 40:34.440
Please.

502
40:37.000 --> 40:38.480
That's your table.

503
40:38.480 --> 40:39.280
Okay.

504
41:04.840 --> 41:05.760
Ms. Peem.

505
41:06.600 --> 41:07.560
Is something wrong?

506
41:11.000 --> 41:12.240
Nothing.

507
41:26.680 --> 41:27.600
Here's your menu.

508
41:27.600 --> 41:28.600
Thanks.

509
41:37.000 --> 41:38.680
Anything you'd like to eat, Ms. Peem?

510
41:42.960 --> 41:44.760
It's your regular place. I can eat anything.

511
41:45.560 --> 41:46.360
Okay.

512
41:55.520 --> 41:56.800
Would you like to move to another table?

513
41:58.920 --> 41:59.880
It's alright.

514
42:08.520 --> 42:10.120
Then let's do as we discussed.

515
42:10.880 --> 42:12.800
I'll set a date for you to meet my family.

516
42:14.000 --> 42:15.520
Speaking as someone in the same field.

517
42:17.680 --> 42:20.080
There are certain types of women you shouldn't bring into your home.

518
42:20.080 --> 42:21.520
Doing so could cause trouble to your livelihood.

519
42:26.640 --> 42:28.720
You shouldn't introduce them to your family.

520
42:29.280 --> 42:31.040
Please take this as a warning given out of concern.

521
42:39.920 --> 42:41.320
You can just see me off here.

522
42:41.640 --> 42:43.080
Let’s have a meal together again sometime.

523
42:43.480 --> 42:44.160
Sure.

524
42:57.640 --> 42:58.960
I'll get going.

525
42:58.960 --> 42:59.920
Okay.

526
43:11.240 --> 43:12.160
Ms. Peem.

527
43:13.920 --> 43:15.240
Don't touch me.

528
43:17.600 --> 43:19.360
Are you and him...

529
43:19.360 --> 43:20.600
We're together.

530
43:25.440 --> 43:27.440
Who I date is my own business.

531
43:28.720 --> 43:30.800
You went official with Techin too.

532
43:36.840 --> 43:39.400
Does he still pay you every time you get in his bed?

533
43:42.240 --> 43:43.720
I'm happy for you

534
43:44.120 --> 43:45.720
that you've found someone good.

535
43:46.440 --> 43:48.160
You seem to be really compatible.

536
43:51.280 --> 43:55.000
It's normal for people of the same level to be compatible.

537
43:57.200 --> 43:59.240
Mr. David is much better than you.

538
43:59.240 --> 44:02.400
I wouldn't feel the least bit embarrassed to be seen with him.

539
44:04.200 --> 44:05.800
It still baffles me

540
44:05.800 --> 44:09.000
how Techin dares to take a whore home and introduce her to his family.

541
44:14.280 --> 44:16.120
I shouldn't have walked up to you.

542
44:22.600 --> 44:23.480
Wait.

543
44:26.240 --> 44:29.800
Don't tell anyone about us.

544
44:31.120 --> 44:32.120
I'm ashamed of it.

545
44:36.320 --> 44:37.240
Okay.

546
45:17.000 --> 45:17.960
Hey.

547
45:30.080 --> 45:31.280
I missed you so much.

548
45:45.240 --> 45:46.320
Lately,

549
45:47.080 --> 45:49.400
my family has been keeping a close eye on me.

550
45:50.920 --> 45:51.800
Why?

551
45:52.720 --> 45:54.480
Do they want you to get married?

552
45:55.680 --> 45:56.640
Yeah.

553
45:58.840 --> 46:00.000
And they're wondering

554
46:01.360 --> 46:02.760
if I like men.

555
46:07.200 --> 46:10.400
But it's good that your family likes that girl.

556
46:11.720 --> 46:13.800
It helps clear that up a little.

557
46:17.480 --> 46:19.360
I want to hold your hand

558
46:21.160 --> 46:23.720
and walk outside without being afraid of anyone too.

559
46:37.720 --> 46:39.000
Whenever you're ready,

560
46:41.160 --> 46:42.480
I'll be happy to do it with you.

561
46:54.360 --> 46:55.920
Then you wipe it for me.

562
47:04.280 --> 47:06.840
If I pay today, I can do it now.

563
47:09.080 --> 47:10.160
Ms. Peem.

564
47:10.160 --> 47:12.560
Didn't she tell you I'm gay?

565
47:14.160 --> 47:15.400
Please get out.

566
47:17.080 --> 47:18.480
Get out!

567
47:22.480 --> 47:29.360
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

568
47:29.360 --> 47:34.280
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

569
47:34.880 --> 47:37.600
♪ I don't understand ♪

570
47:37.600 --> 47:42.960
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

571
47:42.960 --> 47:47.240
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪
